         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This report shares actionable intelligence and proven threat hunting and incident response methods used by the RSA Incident Response Team to successfully respond to an intrusion in early-to-mid 2017 by the threat actor group known as CARABANK, also known as FIN7.   Included with this report is a Digital Appendix used to identify and track attacker activity throughout the environment during this incident.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
