<</CreationDate(D:20171110163214-05'00')/Creator(Adobe InDesign CC 2017 \(Macintosh\))/ModDate(D:20171110163235-05'00')/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 15.0)/Subject(This report shares actionable intelligence and proven threat hunting and incident response methods used by the RSA Incident Response Team to successfully respond to an intrusion in early-to-mid 2017 by the threat actor group known as CARABANK, also known \
as FIN7.   Included with this report is a Digital Appendix used to identify and track attacker activity throughout the environment during this incident.)/Title(Inside the Response of a Unique CARABANK Intrusion)/Trapped/false>>
endobj
